GET /v1/branches/{branch_id_or_ref}
Fetches configurations of the specified database branch
Required: branch_id_or_ref (path) — Branch ref or deprecated branch ID

PATCH /v1/branches/{branch_id_or_ref}
Updates the configuration of the specified database branch
Required: branch_id_or_ref (path) — Branch ref or deprecated branch ID; body (body)
